    "steam_appid": 1653800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.poster.avif?t=1748018919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.webm?t=1748018919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.mp4?t=1748018919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>On the Hunt is a first-person wild animal hunting simulator. A game with a fairly well-developed world of wildlife. Wild animals are very circumspect and careful, hunt down and develop your hunter skill!<br>Test your new weapon at the shooting range and go hunting for the beast in these beautiful places as soon as possible!<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large number of picturesque locations for hunting, at different times of the year.<br></li><li>Decide for yourself: to hunt in sports excitement or meditatively walk around the area.<br></li><li>A wide selection of smooth-bore and rifled weapons and cartridges for them.<br></li><li>Hunting animals: elk, wild boar, deer, bear, wolf, fox...<br></li><li>Upgrade system of experience and ammunition.<br><br>Hunting in various scenic regions is fun and exciting!<br>Have a good hunting !!!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.poster.avif?t=1748018919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.webm?t=1748018919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.mp4?t=1748018919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>On the Hunt is a first-person wild animal hunting simulator. A game with a fairly well-developed world of wildlife. Wild animals are very circumspect and careful, hunt down and develop your hunter skill!<br>Test your new weapon at the shooting range and go hunting for the beast in these beautiful places as soon as possible!<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large number of picturesque locations for hunting, at different times of the year.<br></li><li>Decide for yourself: to hunt in sports excitement or meditatively walk around the area.<br></li><li>A wide selection of smooth-bore and rifled weapons and cartridges for them.<br></li><li>Hunting animals: elk, wild boar, deer, bear, wolf, fox...<br></li><li>Upgrade system of experience and ammunition.<br><br>Hunting in various scenic regions is fun and exciting!<br>Have a good hunting !!!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become a top class hunter polish your shooting skill to perfection!",
