        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 quad core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible with 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> There is a test scene to check compatibility.</li></ul>",
